{"id":"msg_m_nikke_poli_04_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_acpu_s","label":"A.C.P.U. · Chat"},"label":"1. Poli!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_nikke_poli_04_02","speakers":{"miranda":"Miranda","poli":"Poli"},"icons":{"miranda":"si_c032_00_s","poli":"si_c030_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_1","text":"Poli!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_2","text":"I found the records of the person in charge!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_3","text":"Great! So, they were there?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_4","text":"Sure were!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_5","text":"It was hidden in the security room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_6","text":"I don't know why, but the security there was really tight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_7","text":"I had to sneak in super duper quietly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_8","text":"When I opened the door,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_9","text":"I started to have some misgivings and guilt...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_10","text":"But Poly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_11","text":"Whoops, typo!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_12","text":"Miranda, would you PLEASE stop going over every minute detail?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_13","text":"Just tell me, who's been assigned to find the boss's dog?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_14","text":"It's...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_15","text":"Poli!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_16","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_17","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_18","text":"Really? You're not lying, are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_19","text":"I never lie!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_20","text":"While the mission was still ongoing, the target was killed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_21","text":"Poli then went on an extended vacation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_poli_04_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_poli_04_01_22","text":"The case was closed.","jump":null}],"chat":true}